<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA PANK GIVES SYNDICATED LOAN DETAILS.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA PANK GIVES SYNDICATED LOAN DETAILS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank said on Wednesday that its 30 million mark syndicated loan is for a maturity of three years and the interest rate is LIBOR plus 1.375 percent.</p>
<p>The subscription, which started on Wedneday, lasts for two weeks and Tallinna Pank plans to sign the loan agreement at the end of April, the bank added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
